
# Cell Workbench

>  A Glimpse Into The Gems

---
The &bGlyph Workbench&r is used to &aalter the behavior of &bGlyphstones&r. When accessing its interface, you can place the &bGlyph&r you wish to edit into the upper right slot, and then use the center inventory to &adefine what items this Glyph will accept&r.

You can define items by &6clicking and dragging them into the Workbench&r, either from your own inventory, or from &lJEI&r. Additionally, if you already have the desired items stored on the Glyphstone, you can &6choose the wrench icon in the upper left&r. You can also clear configured items by &aclicking the x icon&r.

You can insert an &bInverter Tablet&r to make the Glyphstone &areject the configured items&r instead.
            